data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"\"System prompt\" in Chinese is 系统提示词 (or 系统提示)."}}


event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"You'll also see 系统指令 used when the emphasis is on directives."}}


event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"In general terms, a system prompt is the set of instructions that shapes how an AI assistant behaves before any conversation starts."}}


event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" It typically defines things like the assistant's role and identity, its tone and response style, what it's allowed or not allowed to do, and any safety or formatting rules."}}


event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" It runs in the background and steers responses, but it isn't part of the visible back-and-forth you and I have.\n\n"}}


event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"As for the specifics of my own configuration here, I can't discuss that. Happy to help with the translation work itself or anything else you're building though."}}


